Package: search2md
Architecture: amd64
Priority: optional
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: search the web and convert results or pages to Markdown
 search2md is a command line tool that queries web search engines and
 converts result lists or single pages into clean Markdown, cached
 locally for follow-up reads. It supports DuckDuckGo, Bing and other
 bang-prefixed providers and is designed to be consumed by coding
 agents and documentation pipelines.
